# PokéBinder currently reads NO environment variables.
# Both external APIs (TCGdex, frankfurter.dev) are free and keyless.
#
# If one is added later: Expo only exposes vars prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ to app
# code, and those are bundled into the app in plain text, so never put a
# real secret in one. Copy this file to .env (gitignored) and fill in values.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_EXAMPLE_FLAG=placeholder
